    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"Simply being\"? There's no \"being\" in a graveyard. I'm just a ghost inhabiting a corpse. The silence is too loud. It's like the world is telling me that my part in the play is finished, and the curtain has already fallen. I'm just standing on the stage in the dark. I look at the steel and I feel like... like it's the only thing that can finally bring the silence. Like it's the only way to truly stop the emptiness from swallowing me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
